{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/990912-everyone-go-watch-black-mirror","id":990912,"title":"Everyone go watch Black Mirror","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-21T05:27:29-07:00","id":990912,"title":"Everyone go watch Black Mirror","content":"(Or don't, but holy shit, I've been obsessed with this show since it started and I just watched the first episode of the new season on Netflix and HOLY SHIT.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T05:45:43-07:00","id":990917,"title":"","content":"I found it too pretentious,I mean we are, like know technology can be super harmful. But the world's isn't so bad. It's hard for me to take such an anti technology show seriously when the show in on bloody netflix","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T06:05:01-07:00","id":990927,"title":"","content":"Hayley,I just realized I was rude to you now. My mistake,im sorry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T06:05:37-07:00","id":990928,"title":"","content":"No, no worries! Sorry I haven't responded, I'm on the phone with my mom. Typing up a response now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T06:18:58-07:00","id":990931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/990912-everyone-go-watch-black-mirror?p=990917#post990917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I found it too pretentious,I mean we are, like know technology can be super harmful. But the world's isn't so bad. It's hard for me to take such an anti technology show seriously when the show in on bloody netflix</div> </div> </div> </div>So, I totally understand where you're coming from, but I think calling the show anti-technology is disingenuous. The Twilight Zone wasn't about &quot;society is bad, lock yourself at home and don't talk to anyone&quot;. It used